    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a high school girl stranded on a deserted island. Craft tools, find food, and strive to escape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic survival with parameters like hydration, sleep, and illness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island's layout changes each time you play, offering fresh strategies with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and story scenarios are included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're free to ignore the story and play however you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each run, your score is displayed and ranked online against other players.</p></li></ul>",
